---

Dataset (catalog/, prices/, maps/, raw/): CC0 1.0 Universal
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The dataset compiles factual public information — card names, collector
numbers, set structures, and point-in-time market prices. Facts belong to no
one; to whatever extent this compilation carries rights of its own, they are
waived and the compilation is dedicated to the public domain. Provenance is
recorded per file for data lineage: pokemon-tcg-data / pokemontcg.io,
tcgdex.net, Scryfall, YGOPRODeck, Lorcast, optcgapi, riftcodex, and TCGplayer
market data via tcgcsv.com. Card images are not included in this repository;
image URLs reference their original hosts and remain © their respective
owners (The Pokémon Company, Wizards of the Coast, Konami, Disney, Bandai,
Riot Games).
